---
import Section from "../shared/Section.astro";
import { profile } from "../../utils/profile";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Section id="about" eyebrow="About" title="Short version">
  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:gap-12">
    <!-- Small, tightly cropped. The source is a casual photo; a proper headshot
         is the highest-value asset swap (see docs/04-phase-1.md). -->
    <div class="shrink-0" data-reveal>
      <img
        src={`${base}images/ashishp1.jpeg`}
        alt="Ashish Kumar Jha"
        width="160"
        height="160"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        class="h-32 w-32 rounded-2xl border border-line object-cover [object-position:50%_22%] md:h-40 md:w-40"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-ink-2" data-reveal data-reveal-index="1">
      <p>
        I'm a backend engineer based in {profile.location}. I spend most of my time in
        Java and Spring Boot — designing schemas, writing services, and working out
        what happens when two requests want the same row at the same moment.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started at Novoinvent Software as an intern in 2023 and moved into an
        engineering role in 2024. The work has been full-stack in practice, but the
        backend is where I've gone deep: multi-tenancy, concurrency control, caching,
        and getting services onto AWS in containers.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work I build things to understand them properly. The task scheduler
        in my projects exists because I wanted to know how one actually behaves at the
        thread level, not because I needed a scheduler. Right now I'm building an
        LLM agent harness for the same reason.
      </p>

      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-4 border-t border-line pt-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <dt class="mono-label">Focus</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink">Backend · Java</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="mono-label">Currently</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink">Novoinvent Software</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="mono-label">Learning</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink">LLM agent tooling</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
